ens’ General Obligation Bond Oversight Committee", "text": "July 2005 follow-up", "mark": "July 2005 follow-up"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.25, 0.55, 0.92, 1.02, 1.39, 1.7, 1.77, 1.86, 2.18, 2.42, 2.75, 2.86, 3.15, 3.23, 3.35]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "After the July presentation, the committee said the Controller had approved the district’s new procedures.", "t0": 40.13, "t1": 44.05, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Oversight response"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.36, 0.64, 1.19, 1.29, 1.61, 1.77, 1.87, 2.27, 2.37, 2.69, 2.79, 3.16, 3.29]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 44.17, "t1": 46.16, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.6, 0.74, 0.98, 1.08, 1.16, 1.39, 1.63]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"funds": "Where did the interest go?", "oversight": "What the oversight committee saw"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "question"}